    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but sometimes the math just doesnt work out. like, if an ai tool can do the work of three people for like a fraction of the cost, isn't it just bad business to keep those three people on payroll? even if it feels a bit harsh, shouldn't the priority be the company's efficiency and long-term survival?",
